  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Infurnity, also known as The East Asian Community, is an annual furry convention in Taiwan and the first public furry event in the country, organized by JC. The first was held October 31, 2015, in Taipei with 62 attendees. It has since been held in Taoyuan and at the Fullon Hotel Tamsui in New Taipei City, became a two-day event in 2018, and was held online in 2020 and 2021. Its main charity is the Raptor Research Group of Taiwan, and attendance has grown to over 3,200 in 2025.",
